@title Lesson walk: simulate-3d (3D view, Heat panel, Quick run, verdict, labels)
@area Learn
# The Heat panel keeps clear of the lesson card (a short panel at 1366x768). The lesson from the palette, in the hot cabinet sample. Do it for me only carries out commands, so the Heat button, the Quick choice and the Simulate button are really clicked. The Quick run takes seconds to a minute on a worker thread.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text simulate
wait 6
click_text "Heat and air in 3D: the Simulate run"
wait 40
shot 01-why
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 02-open-3d
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 40
shot 03-heat-panel-step
check_layout
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
shot 04-settings-step
check_layout
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
# At 1366x768 the Heat panel is short beside the lesson card (the step says "scroll it"): scroll to the Quality choices, pick Quick, scroll back up to Simulate.
move 1190 330
wait 5
scroll 1190 330 -90
wait 10
click_text Quick RadioButton
wait 10
shot 05-quick-chosen
scroll 1190 330 300
wait 10
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 06-simulate-step
check_layout
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 100
wait 60
wait_s 100
wait 60
expect "Coarse 3D"
expect "Result for this layout"
shot 07-verdict-step-result
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 08-labels-step
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 09-stale-step
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 10-estimate-step
check_layout
